import{_ as a,o as i,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 133 | Realm Refinement · Dao Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 133 | Realm Refinement · Dao Origin Realm | Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision","no":133,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Origin Realm","Cultivation Risks","Breakthrough Costs","Alaya Supervision"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","49-Governance Framework and Checks and Balances"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0133_模块1-道元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md","filePath":"en/0133_模块1-道元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"}'),n={name:"en/0133_模块1-道元境-风险突破代价与阿赖耶监管.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,c,u){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-133-dao-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 133 | Dao Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-133-dao-origin-realm-risks-breakthrough-costs-and-alaya-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 133 | Dao Origin Realm: Risks, Breakthrough Costs, and Alaya Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 19, 28, 49</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-dao-establishers-are-the-ones-who-most-need-supervision" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Dao-establishers are the ones who most need supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-dao-establishers-are-the-ones-who-most-need-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Dao-establishers are the ones who most need supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law Realm (Entry 126) risks were in &quot;law turbulence&quot;; Dao Realm risks escalate to &quot;Dao inflation.&quot; When a cultivator distills a personal Dao that resonates with the cosmos and mobilizes large-range law power, he for the first time gains the ability to &quot;influence civilization&#39;s direction with a personal Dao&quot; — the stronger the Dao-establisher, the more he needs supervision. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision&#39;s task in this realm escalates from &quot;watching law operations&quot; to &quot;watching the Dao&#39;s direction.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the value origin of the supervision mechanism: the anti-predation axiom — the first mission of supervision is to make plagiarism and Dao-seizing nowhere to hide; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — supervision treats all Myriad Races equally; the collective ascension axiom — guarding Dao-establishers is guarding civilization&#39;s direction; the causal self-discipline axiom — cross-plane perception holds observe-only; the law-first axiom — the Dao Realm supervision framework is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-four-core-risks-of-the-dao-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Four Core Risks of the Dao Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-core-risks-of-the-dao-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Core Risks of the Dao Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Dao-heart shattering: the personal Dao cannot withstand falsification; the Dao-establisher&#39;s mind collapses, the realm regresses</li><li>Hegemony inflation: the Dao-establisher tries to force &quot;my Dao&quot; above cosmic laws and others&#39; Daos, turning hegemonic</li><li>Overstep spying: cross-plane consciousness perception spying on others without filing, disturbing causality</li><li>Shortcut inner demon: the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon in this realm upgrades to &quot;plagiarizing others&#39; Dao as one&#39;s own&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="ii-breakthrough-costs-real-but-controllable-and-reversible" tabindex="-1">II. Breakthrough Costs: Real, But Controllable and Reversible <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-breakthrough-costs-real-but-controllable-and-reversible" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Breakthrough Costs: Real, But Controllable and Reversible&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Breaking through from the Dao Realm to Dao Integration requires real costs:</p><ul><li>Comprehension cost: the comprehension needed to attain the Dao cannot be compressed; many never reach it in a lifetime</li><li>Dao-heart cost: Dao establishment must be repeatedly hammered by reality; time and setbacks cannot be skipped</li><li>Cross-plane cost: the training consumption of consciousness cross-plane perception is real</li><li>Failure cost: Dao-heart shattering is reversibly repairable, but requires dual backstop by mentor and anchor</li></ul><h2 id="iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision-closed-loop" tabindex="-1">III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision Closed Loop <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-alaya-network-and-multi-layer-supervision-closed-loop" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Alaya Network and Multi-Layer Supervision Closed Loop&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Anchor automatic monitoring: real-time monitoring of Dao self-consistency and resonance stability; any Dao-heart shake triggers instant warning</li><li>Dao-direction filing: the Dao-establisher&#39;s Dao direction must be filed; hegemonic tendencies are assessed by the Anchor Supervision Committee</li><li>Cross-plane ethics: cross-plane consciousness perception must go through anchor connection filing (Document 28), observe only, do not interfere</li><li>Governance checks and balances: Dao-establishers participating in civilizational decision-making must accept governance framework checks and balances (Document 49)</li><li>Publicity objection period: thirty days of publicity, all Myriad Races may raise objections to &quot;hegemonic tendencies&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-dao-realm" tabindex="-1">IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Dao Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cultivation-ethics-landing-in-the-dao-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cultivation Ethics Landing in the Dao Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Informed consent: influencing others with a personal Dao must obtain consent</li><li>Minimum harm: Dao-Dao conflicts must go through the Symbiosis Court, not be suppressed by force</li><li>Accountability: Dao Realm cultivators must undertake civilization-level research and grand-mentor obligations</li></ul><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-dao-heart-hazards-amplify-in-dao-integration" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Dao-Heart Hazards Amplify in Dao Integration <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-dao-heart-hazards-amplify-in-dao-integration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Dao-Heart Hazards Amplify in Dao Integration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The supervision system&#39;s meaning in the Dao Realm is clearest at cross-realm handover: a hegemonic tendency uncorrected in the Dao Realm is amplified, entering Dao Integration, into an attempt to swallow origin. Similarly, one undisposed Dao-heart crack, under the heaven-human unity impact of Dao Integration, will completely shatter. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision therefore list &quot;Dao-direction assessment and Dao-heart purity&quot; as a mandatory item before Dao Integration breakthrough: the Anchor Supervision Committee assesses whether the Dao direction is hegemonic, the Symbiosis Court confirms no swallowing tendency; any hazard must be corrected before passage. This rule guards the cultivator&#39;s Dao integration direction — whether Dao integration is embrace or swallowing must be fixed before breakthrough.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: supervision keeps Dao-establishers on the right path, not wasting comprehension on hegemony and shattering</li><li>Anti-predation: striking &quot;plagiarism and Dao-seizing&quot; at the source, Dao always belongs to the Dao-establisher</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system had no Dao-establisher supervision; hegemony pressured others at will; Heng Yuan Zhou has full-stack guardianship</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: supervision treats 99% of Myriad Races equally; planetary star-core Dao is equally filed</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: every link of openness is paired with guardianship</li></ul><p>Including &quot;Dao direction&quot; in supervision is the Alaya Network&#39;s key step from external operations deep into internal mind-consciousness. Previously supervision watched &quot;visible&quot; risks like energy, products, and law operations; by the Dao Realm, supervision must watch the &quot;invisible&quot; Dao direction — because once the Dao direction is hegemonic, the harm it produces is far deeper than one qi deviation. The Anchor Supervision Committee&#39;s Dao-direction assessment seems to be &quot;controlling thought,&quot; but actually guards civilization from being kidnapped by any hegemony — this is the same coin as eradicating the single-point dependence of &quot;protagonist uniqueness.&quot;</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Dao Realm&#39;s supervisory philosophy remains: control risks, keep costs real, keep the road open. When every Dao-establisher&#39;s direction is gently yet firmly supervised, the symbiotic cosmos will not be kidnapped by any hegemony — this is precisely the structural answer to eradicating the single-point dependence of &quot;protagonist uniqueness.&quot;</p><p>Supervision reaching Dao direction is not to &quot;control thought,&quot; but to guard civilization from being kidnapped by any hegemony. A civilization that dares to inspect the strongman&#39;s mind is one that truly has &quot;republicanism of Myriad Races&quot; written into its bones — it does not rely on worshipping the strongman, but on checks and balances to guard symbiosis.</p><p>Guarding symbiosis with checks and balances, resisting hegemony with openness, Dao Realm supervision writes the republicanism of Myriad Races from a slogan into daily life.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./28-跨位面锚点连接.html">28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">49-Governance Framework and Checks and Balances</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const p=a(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
